# Deliberately minimal. This repository is served verbatim by Pages, so
# anything ignored here is simply absent from the published site. Do NOT
# paste in a language template: the Python one ignores /site as mkdocs
# build output, which in a repository like this quietly keeps the whole
# homepage out of every commit and publishes an empty artifact.
